  <!-- EN: advanced flesh hive -->
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.label>高级血肉巢穴</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.label>
  <!-- EN: Unlocks large fleshbeast fusion, advanced mother-beast fusion when the required mother-beast node is available, nerve centers, fleshmass spitters, flesh burst launchers, and parasite expansion packs. -->
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.description>解锁大型血肉兽结合、在具备所需母兽结节时结合高级母兽、神经中枢、血肉喷吐器、血肉爆炸器，以及寄生扩容背包。</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.description>
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.0>大型血肉兽结合</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.0>
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.1>高级母兽结合</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.1>
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.2>神经中枢</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.2>
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.3>血肉喷吐器</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.3>
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.4>血肉爆炸器</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.4>
  <FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.5>寄生扩容背包</FH_Research_AdvancedFleshHive.customUnlockTexts.5>
  
  <!-- EN: basic flesh hive -->
  <FH_Research_BasicFleshHive.label>基础血肉巢穴</FH_Research_BasicFleshHive.label>
  <!-- EN: Unlocks basic flesh hive cultivation, basic fleshbeasts, flesh hoppers, flesh trees, flesh doors, flesh blocks, flesh lamps, and efficient flesh expansion research. -->
  <FH_Research_BasicFleshHive.description>解锁基础血肉巢穴培育、基础血肉兽、产出物喷口、血肉树、血肉门、血肉块、血肉灯，以及高效血肉扩张研究。</FH_Research_BasicFleshHive.description>
