  <FH_Research_EfficientNutritionAbsorption.label>高效营养吸收</FH_Research_EfficientNutritionAbsorption.label>
  <!-- EN: Increases nutrition gained from corpses, food, and flesh sacks by 50%. -->
  <FH_Research_EfficientNutritionAbsorption.description>从尸体、食物和血肉袋获得的营养提高50%。</FH_Research_EfficientNutritionAbsorption.description>
