  <!-- EN: self-repairing flesh -->
  <FH_Research_SelfRepairFlesh.label>自修复血肉</FH_Research_SelfRepairFlesh.label>
  <!-- EN: Allows flesh buildings to consume hive nutrition to repair their own hit points over time. -->
  <FH_Research_SelfRepairFlesh.description>允许血肉建筑消耗巢穴营养，并随时间自行恢复耐久。</FH_Research_SelfRepairFlesh.description>
  <FH_Research_SelfRepairFlesh.customUnlockTexts.0>血肉建筑消耗巢穴营养进行自我修复</FH_Research_SelfRepairFlesh.customUnlockTexts.0>
  
